# Ruby sources are checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# The applier tests read scripts/apply_transcript_delta.rb as text and slice it
# with anchored regexes. Under a CRLF checkout those anchors stop matching, so
# the tests either fail or silently scan the wrong span. Pinning Ruby to LF
# keeps host runs and container runs reading byte-identical sources.
*.rb text eol=lf
